# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DATA POLICY — read before changing
#
# Everything under data/ is currently TRACKED on purpose, and it is small
# enough to stay that way (~120 MB total, largest single file 73 MB).
#
# It is tracked because data/SOURCES.md still has two OPEN licence questions:
#   1. whether the BCS questions came from a redistributable source
#   2. what licence the released corpus carries (Wikipedia CC BY-SA 4.0
#      share-alike likely propagates to it)
#
# Until BOTH are answered, do not push this repository to a public remote.
# A private remote is fine. See data/SOURCES.md "Open actions".
#
# If the answer turns out to be "not redistributable", uncomment the lines
# below to untrack the source pool, and keep only the scripts that rebuild it:
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/raw/bn_qa_pool/*.jsonl
# data/interim/*.jsonl

# Reviewer working copies of the annotation sheets. The BLANK template and the
# answer key are tracked; individual annotators' filled-in copies are not, so
# two people can work in the same clone without colliding.
data/annotated/agreement_test_v1/items_*.csv
!data/annotated/agreement_test_v1/items_for_annotation_BLANK.csv

# Scratch
/tmp/
scratch/
*.tmp
